   * The key will be matched against **unescaped** JSON:
   *
   *   dom::parser parser;
   *   int64_t(parser.parse(R"({ "a\n": 1 })"_padded)["a\n"]) == 1
   *   parser.parse(R"({ "a\n": 1 })"_padded)["a\\n"].get_uint64().error() == NO_SUCH_FIELD
